WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.890
Are you going to wake up or not?

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.230
Ah... Lack of sleep is bad for the skin.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.730
I'm going on ahead.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.480
Good morning.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.540
"Good morning", you say. It's almost lunchtime already.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.770
It can't be helped. Lately I've been having nightmares so I can't sleep well.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:25.880
Nightmares?

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.340
Vanilla, Chocolat, Caramel, Cafe.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.720
W-Who's there?

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.270
I serve the Queen. My name is Davalon.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.150
I also supervise the Spirits exams.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.340
Examiner?

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:46.100
Though it's sudden, you four, Vanilla, Chocolat, Caramel and Cafe.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.250
None of you have been sending in the required monthly number of Sweets Cards.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.650
So you have to return to the Kingdom of Sweets and take the supplementary exams.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.200
No way! We've done our best to make cards!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.210
Ah. But recently, we've had the special training for the Cake Grand Prix going on,

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:05.960
so we haven't made any Sweets Cards lately.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:09.810
Anyways, the exams for the four of you have been decided.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:14.740
Until you pass them, you won't be able to come back to the human world,

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:19.020
so you need to pack up your belongings and prepare to set forth to the Kingdom.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:23.150
No way! Does that mean I can't meet Ichigo and the others again until I pass?

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:27.560
It can't be helped. The road to becoming a pâtissière is a difficult one.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:36.190
Today, the 13th oven's door will be open. You have to be prepared by then to return to the Kingdom.

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:38.080
Until then, I'll be waiting for you.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.310
He said "supplementary exams". This sucks.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:46.580
So the nightmares I've been having recently must have foreseen this.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:52.750
And the returning to the Kingdom will be our end. We won't be able to return to the human world again.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.900
Eh!? Hey, Chocolat! Don't say such strange things!

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:01.420
I don't want that! I don't want to leave everyone like this...

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:07.110
OP sequence

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:15.120
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:15.120
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.450
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:20.450
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:25.950
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:25.950
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.130
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.130
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.110
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.110
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.020
Bon appétit!

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:43.380
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:43.380
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.020
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.020
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.030
Courage!

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:53.810
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:53.810
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.580
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.580
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:01.940
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:02:56.580 --> 00:03:01.940
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:08.040
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:08.040
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:13.270
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:13.270
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:19.290
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:19.290
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:24.650
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:24.650
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:29.180
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:29.180
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.350
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:31.350
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.860
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:43.200
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.570
Are you going back to the Kingdom of Sweets?

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.880
Yeah.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.210
Have a safe trip.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:54.170
I wonder what kinda souvenir will you get for me?

00:03:54.530 --> 00:04:00.530
No, Ichigo! The truth is that the examiner came today and said that we didn't make enough Sweets Cards,

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:03.890
and so we have to go back to the Kingdom of Sweets to take supplementary exams.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:07.560
And then, until we pass it, we can't return to this world.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:13.600
No way! I thought that I'd be able to make a lot of delicious sweets with you, Vanilla.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:20.110
Ichigo. Even if I'm not around, you'll still do your best to become a top class pâtissière right?

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.570
Vanilla.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.120
I thought that I wouldn't cry, but it's impossible for me after all!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:32.240
No way! I don't want to leave you!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:36.130
Don't cry, Vanilla. You'll come back after you pass it, right?

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:42.010
It'll be fine! Vanilla is a fighter, after all. You'll definitely pass quickly.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.480
You think so?

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.650
Yeah, definitely.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:49.380
Yeah, you're right. I just have to pass the supplementary exams, right?

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:54.040
I'll do my best! And then I'll come back quickly, Ichigo.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.030
That's the spirit!

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:55.880
Yeah!

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:59.080
Even for me, if Vanilla wasn't here, I'd be lonely.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.610
But now, I can only believe in her and wait for her return.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.270
Supplementary exams, huh? Spirits have it hard too.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:06.820
Yeah.

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:10.620
Just thinking about supplementary exams is depressing, but...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.290
Isn't it great to think that you'll be able to go back to your home to refresh yourself?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.870
I see. I should think of it that way.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:20.540
Here. Drink this.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.250
Wow! It's a rose, isn't it?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.750
A toast to our temporary farewell.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.510
Cheers.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.400
I will send you off.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.930
Thank you, Satsuki.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:37.950
recipe 27

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:37.950
Surprise Sweets

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:42.230
Where did that Kashino go?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.320
I don't want to go!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.890
There, there.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:49.660
I'll pray everyday for your quick return.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.830
Now, I will help you with your packing.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.250
Kashino.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:57.460
Don't come here.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.620
I've just finished running, so I'm really sweaty.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.910
Ah, is that so...

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:03.880
Is something the matter?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.170
Eh? No, not really...

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.440
I want to take a shower.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.610
Ah! Oh no, I'm sorry!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.520
Then...

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:14.630
Ah, Kashino.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:15.210
Huh?

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.080
Umm...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.190
Bye bye.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:26.130
In the end, I didn't tell him anything.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.190
I'm so stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.720
Thank you for seeing me off.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:35.790
Well then, Ichigo. I'll be going.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.830
Take care.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.820
And, good luck on your supplementary exams.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.250
Yeah! I'll do my best!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.880
I'm leaving!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.300
Everyone already went ahead, huh?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.160
<i>Someone check this oven.</i>

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:02.050
Umm... I've been told to participate in the supplementary exams...

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:06.940
Supplementary exams? Oh, your kitchen is at the end of the other side.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.480
Thank you very much.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.290
You're slow, Vanilla!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.240
A little bit longer and you'd be late!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.290
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.120
Has everyone gathered?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.410
Yes!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.390
So, do you know what the day after tomorrow is?

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:29.460
Day after tomorrow? Umm...

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.260
What was it?

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.740
It's the anniversary of the Queen's coronation.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.790
Oh!

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:36.810
That's right...

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.660
Since it's the year of independence,

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:46.860
we are planning to have a gorgeous celebration, and decorate the central plaza with the beauty of sweets art.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.300
Awesome!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.530
Oh, so that's the reason why the palace kitchen was so busy.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.480
And this will be your supplementary exam.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:59.580
You four will work together and create a Sweets sculpture to display at the plaza.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.740
So that's a supplementary exam? What the heck.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.600
I can finish a sculpture before my breakfast.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.860
The theme this time is Surprise Sweets. There's a catch, however.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:16.270
The product must be a sweet that excites the citizens during the welcoming of the Queens coronation anniversary.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.740
Surprise Sweets?

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:25.190
Exercise your intelligence and make an amazing Surprise Sweets. Got it?

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.080
What should we do?

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.120
Even if you say that, I can't think of anything right away.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:38.740
For now, let's think of what kind of Surprise Sweets we'll do and draw them on paper.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.830
Okay!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:46.030
Hey, hey. What does "Surprise" mean?

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:50.170
To overwhelm, or excite others. Something like that.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.660
I get it!

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.300
Here! How's this?

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:01.520
What are you drawing!? That won't work!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.170
Vanilla's done, too!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.690
Surprise resort!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:11.190
Donut

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:11.190
Fresh cream

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:11.190
Jelly

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:11.190
I've thought of a donut inner tube in a pool filled with Jelly, and fresh cream showers!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.910
Wow! Amazing!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.140
It will make your body sticky...

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.700
That won't work at all.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.920
I thought it was good...

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:24.360
However, mine's very realistic. And it's totally gorgeous.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:27.120
Ta-da! A castle made of Japanese confectioneries!

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.620
Didn't we do it the last time!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.620
You don't have to yell that loud...

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:36.110
Everyone's really naïve. This is a high class ceremony.

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:41.120
We need to put up a beautiful and artistic work. Something like this!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:46.860
I chose to present a picture using sweets. This is "Chocolat's smile".

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.470
What's that?

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.740
Don't like it?

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:51.690
Then, how about this?

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.080
Chocolat's birthday!

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.350
Eeh!?

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:58.660
Geez, it's because you're all immature children.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.660
There should be a limit to showing off!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:06.880
This and that won't work. So much time has passed and we haven't decided on an idea.

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:14.880
Well if we can't decide, we can go by popular belief. It can't go wrong if we make chocolate sweets.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:20.060
Wait a minute! Speaking of everyone's favorite, it should be vanilla-flavoured sweets!

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:24.130
That's not true! The best one is caramel-flavoured!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.290
It's definitely chocolate!

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.600
No, it's vanilla!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.590
Caramel-flavour!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.940
Then, how about the original coffee taste?

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.150
Just be quiet, Cafe!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.190
Let's conclude this!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:42.280
It's already late today, so let's go sleep.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.640
That sounds good.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:46.990
I agree. Being sleep deprived is bad for my skin.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.120
Well, let's go to sleep.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.830
They were criticizing each other in their faces just a while ago...

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.210
Ichigo, I wonder what she is doing now.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:03.470
I hug her when I sleep, and her body feels so warm and soft. It's so comfortable.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:09.380
When you say that, Caramel is reminded of Andou!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.820
What's with you two? To suddenly get homesick.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:19.420
That's because Ichigo and I are such good friends, so it isn't surprising for me to get lonely.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:24.020
For Caramel, Andou gives off the feeling of a gentle big brother.

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.760
He looks after me a lot.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.650
I respect Satsuki like my senior.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.880
He gives off an air of coolness, doesn't he?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:39.780
When we share our thoughts like this, we are able to understand how important our partners are.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.170
Yeah. How about Chocolat?

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:41.940
Eh?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:45.420
What kind of partner is Kashino to you?

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:49.430
Let's see. It feels like we are a pair of mutual couples.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.470
Eeh?

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:52.590
It doesn't look like that at all.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.090
That's why I said you all are immature children.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:12:01.610
We are able to deeply understand each other's hearts better than anyone else without saying a word.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.260
Oh?

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:06.910
Then, the Kashino right now might be crying over you while sleeping.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.570
That's a definite!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:14.670
Today's another day where I exhausted myself over Amano's clumsiness.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.200
What? Are you already asleep?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.760
Huh? She's not here.

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:23.170
Where could she have gone?

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.510
Well, she'll come back home soon.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.120
Hey, Vanilla! Sleep over on the over side!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.080
It's so cramped that I can't sleep.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.690
It's uncomfortable here, too!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.880
Kick!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.530
What are you doing!?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.460
Chocolate Kick!

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:39.900
Geez... Just hurry up and get to sleep, you two!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.400
Andou~

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.330
<i>For now, a day has passed.</i>

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:48.910
<i>Tomorrow, we'll do our best to make Surprise Sweets!</i>

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:10.180
<i>In the end, she didn't return.</i>

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:12.130
<i>Geez, what could she be doing?</i>

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.810
<i>Don't say she...</i>

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:22.570
<i>Since she's dressed in black, she might've mistaken to be the crow's chick and was caught by it...</i>

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:21.900
It hurts! You're heavy!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.570
<i>Nah, that can't be it.</i>

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.580
<i>No, could it be...</i>

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:32.580
<i>...she was trapped in a giant spider's web and couldn't escape?</i>

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:31.950
No! Help me!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:37.580
Geez! It's a rare holiday, yet you make me worry so early in the morning!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.110
What are you doing?

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.060
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.300
Eh? Since Chocolat wasn't here, you were looking for her...

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.520
Could it be that you didn't hear about it?

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.630
Hear about what?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:09.780
Vanilla, Chocolat and the others went back to their own country.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:13.550
Seriously? She never told me anything about that.

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.450
So? When are they coming back?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:20.710
Well, that could be tomorrow, or in the worst scenario, maybe in a few years.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.670
A few years? What's with that?

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:29.720
For some reason, they didn't make any Sweets Cards lately, so they have to take supplementary exams.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:35.140
Moreover, until they pass, they won't be able to come back here or something...

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:39.440
We're also responsible for their lack of Sweets Cards.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.180
Yeah.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:44.290
We've only been thinking about the Grand Prix lately.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.640
So, we've caused them trouble.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:47.360
Moreover...

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.850
<i>Is something the matter?</i>

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.910
<i>Eh? No, not really...</i>

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.660
Back then, it would have been fine if I had just listened to what she wanted to say.

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.060
What are we going to do?

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:01.060
If they can't come back from the over side, we just need to go over to their side.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.680
Why didn't I realise that earlier?

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:08.330
Welcome to the country of the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.650
Then! Let's get in...

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.460
A-Amano, is there something wrong with your head?

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.460
I can't get in!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:17.830
Ow! I hit my head!

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:20.730
I could care less about you!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:25.160
Today, we'll do our best to complete the Surprise Sweets.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:30.370
Having said that, everyone's opinions are in a mess. It would be difficult to cooperate.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.740
I understood much of Team Ichigo's cooperation.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:37.180
For now, we should start making something instead of just thinking.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:37.990
Chocolat?

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.250
It's rare that Chocolat is being so motivated to do something.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.250
Like I said, stop talking and start moving your hands.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:45.320
Yes.

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:47.870
Chocolat might have a point.

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:50.570
Nothing will come if we're just thinking.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:54.630
Everyone will use their own specailities and bake a Génoise!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.120
Yes!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.120
Okay!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:04.960
Ooh! It looks delicious!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:08.900
What are you planning to do with these four flavours of Génoise?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:13.200
If we combine them into one cake, the flavours will mix up and end up tasting terrible.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:18.620
In these circumstances, Ichigo always came up with the best ideas, didn't she?

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:23.700
Is that so? She's a child who's just good at eating them.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:27.660
She recently ate 50 pieces of cakes at a cake buffet, you know?

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.870
She's definitely a moron, I say.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.510
50 pieces?

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:35.300
But she personally said to me that those cakes were all small ones.

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.300
Ah! That's it!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.480
Eh?

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:40.130
Basically...

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.100
I see!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.780
That'll be perfect!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:44.860
Let's do it!

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.740
Now that we've decided, let's start work on it quickly.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:48.520
Yeah!

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:56.890
It's really tough to work together suddenly.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:02.950
But as long as your desire to make delicious sweets is the same, it'll definitely turn out great.

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:14.620
Today is the anniversary of our Queen's coronation!

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:23.430
Ceremonies are being held all around the Kingdom of Sweets, and soon the Queen will be greeting us all here at the central plaza!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:24.810
It's finally time, isn't it?

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.320
Yeah.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:27.100
Ah! It's the Queen!

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.650
My Queen, please taste this.

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.160
It's made really well.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.670
Thank you very much for your compliments.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:55.350
Next up is our work.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.220
Yes.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.470
This is a really bold piece of work. It's a statue of the Queen!

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:10.190
What in the world!? To uses sweets to make the Queen, it's extremely rude!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.190
We love the Queen, so we used sweets to make her statue.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.390
What are you saying? Put it away immediately!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.710
Isn't this a delicacy?

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:21.190
Queen!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:25.410
This jewel is made of raspberry tart, isn't it?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:31.880
Yes! We used many types of petit fours for the parts of the dress.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:36.920
Really! The dress seems to be made entirely out of petit fours!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:43.600
Using petit fours, we could focus on our specialties and finish it without arguing quickly.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.610
We should really thank Chocolat for this idea.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:50.900
It's a small cake, with lots of different tastes, and it looks exciting to eat.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.880
Then, here we go!

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:54.320
There!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.990
This is... a Sparkling Card.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:09.710
Everyone, thank you for the fun time.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.420
The Queen is going back.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.370
Good evening, Queen.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:18.420
Good evening.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:26.230
I never expected you all to be able to make a Sparkling Card. It's a big success!

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:31.130
This time the Surprise Sweets was a big, big, big success!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:32.270
That means...

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:35.190
Vanilla, Chocolat, Caramel, Cafe.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:40.590
Since the Surprise Sweets was a success, each one of you passed the supplementary exams.

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:41.490
Yay!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:45.490
So, everyone, enjoy the tea time!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.990
Woohoo!

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.270
This is delicious!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.500
What a waste of caramel.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:54.990
You did well. You may return to the academy.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:59.510
This time, you need to properly collect enough cards.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.440
Yes!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.970
Yay! I'm so happy to be able to return to the academy.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.680
We were able to pass it in one try, thanks to everyone's help.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.550
Huh? Chocolat, are you crying?

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.200
I-I'm not crying!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.980
I'm sure she's happy to be returning to Kashino.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.400
How can I put it... Chocolat is homesick.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:27.640
N-No way! What homesickness? Don't put me together with a child.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.150
I'm back, Ichigo.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.380
This place is the best! It's so warm and soft.

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.380
I'm back.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.930
I'm back, Satsuki.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.470
I'm back.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.010
. You're late, Chocolat!
Welcome back.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.520
It has Kashino's style.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.530
<i>Soft and warm.</i>

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.360
She's right. It really is soft and warm.

