Special Event!

00:23:07.730 --> 00:23:12.110
During the Yume-Pati special event for Anime Fair 2010 hosted in Tokyo,

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:14.960
it's the appearance of the Sweets and Sweets Decoration.

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:19.110
This time we actually have the Sweets Princes that are in a dreamy recital contest!

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:25.960
The one who is called the Deco Prince in the World of Sweets Decoration, Watanabe Osamu-san,

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:32.900
who will be having a dreamy collaboration with Sweets Princes Okamoto Nobuhiko-san, Yonaga Tsubasa-san and Hamazoe Shinya-san.

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:38.190
The sweets' sweet points, as well as the easy-going atmosphere around the Sweets Princes,

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.230
have all the Yume-Pati fans falling madly in love.

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:46.860
And also, there is the Sweets Decoration Classroom Meeting where Prince Watanabe is giving advice personally!

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:51.260
I studied with everyone else on how to decorate sweets, too!

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:54.320
Everyone is decorating such cute sweets!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.310
They look just like real sweets!

00:23:56.780 --> 00:23:59.910
Truly a day for a princess, wasn't it?

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:03.150
Eeh? Natsume stopped playing piano?

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:08.640
TL Note: "Nuide" mean two things here, 1) get naked  2) show off.

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:05.810
Okay! Now's the time for Onee-chan to show off!

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:07.820
Eh? Ichigo, you're so daring!

00:24:07.820 --> 00:24:08.640
Not that!

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:12.470
I will cheer her up with sweets just like grandma did with me.

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:13.810
It's still impossible for you.

00:24:13.810 --> 00:24:14.970
Eh? Everyone...

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:16.740
We'll help you out, too.

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:18.140
Leave it to us, Ichigo-chan.

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:20.980
Next episode, Ichigo's and Natsume's Prince.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:23.740
Do you want to eat my dream-coloured sweets?

